# Allowlist: ignore everything, track only declarative config.
# Runtime state, sessions, history, and credentials must never be committed.
# settings.json is tracked: the MCP token is an ${env:...} reference, not a literal.
# settings.local.json stays out — it is per-machine permission state.
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!skills-index.md
!agents/
!agents/**
!skills/
!skills/**

# Skills synced from claude.ai: Claude Code manages them at runtime (lands here via the ~/.claude/skills symlink).
skills/synced/
